{"format_version": 2, "segments": [{"kind": "text", "text": " ἄγε, ἄγετε, imper. of ἄγω, used as Adv., come on! freq. in "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "Hom.", "author_abbreviation": "Hom.", "tlg_author": null, "tlg_work": null, "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", who mostly strengthens it, εἰ δ' ἄγε, νῦν δ' ἄγε, ἄγε δή, ἀλλ' ἄγε, in Att. freq. "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄγε νύν Ar. Eq. 1011", "author_abbreviation": "Ar.", "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": ", etc.; before "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "1", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " and "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "2", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0019", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": " pers. pl., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄγε δὴ τραπείομεν Il. 3.441", "author_abbreviation": "Il.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄγε δὴ στέωμεν 11.348", "author_abbreviation": null, "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "001", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄγε τάμνετε Od. 3.332", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἀλλ' ἄγε, Πέρσαι, φροντίδα θώμεθα A. Pers. 140", "author_abbreviation": "A.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄγε δὴ καὶ χορὸν ἅψωμεν Id. Eu. 307", "author_abbreviation": "Id.", "tlg_author": "0085", "tlg_work": "007", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; rarely before 1 sg., "}, {"kind": "citation", "text": "ἄγε δὴ . . ἀριθμήσω Od. 13.215", "author_abbreviation": "Od.", "tlg_author": "0012", "tlg_work": "002", "dialects": []}, {"kind": "text", "text": "; before 3 pl., "}, {"